{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"5":{"eng-name":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat): Voluntary Prayers","ara-name":"كتاب التطوع"}},"section_detail":{"5":{"hadithnumber_first":1250,"hadithnumber_last":1370,"arabicnumber_first":1250,"arabicnumber_last":1370}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1307,"arabicnumber":1307,"text":"Rapporté par Aïcha (la mère des croyants) رضي الله عنها : Ne délaissez pas la prière de la nuit, car le Messager d’Allah ﷺ ne l’abandonnait jamais. Quand il était malade ou fatigué, il la faisait assis","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":5,"hadith":58},"chapter":{"id":18,"ara-name":"باب قِيَامِ اللَّيْلِ","eng-name":"The (Voluntary) Night Prayer","isFirstHadith":false}}]}